WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.454
With windows and external cladding being
put in place

00:00:06.454 --> 00:00:09.851
and roofing all but finished
it was time to reward the hard work of

00:00:09.851 --> 00:00:12.430
the contractors with a roof shout.

00:00:14.527 --> 00:00:18.215
The mayor and staff visited the site
last week to express their thanks 

00:00:18.215 --> 00:00:20.306
and to view the latest progress.

00:00:21.439 --> 00:00:24.352
As the building gets closer to becoming
weather-tight, 

00:00:24.352 --> 00:00:26.949
the internal rooms are starting to take shape.

00:00:26.949 --> 00:00:31.766
With installation of plumbing, electrical and fire sprinklers all underway

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:40.512
Construction of the facility is on track
and due to be finished in roughly nine months.

00:00:40.512 --> 00:00:45.711
It's expected that the doors will open to the public at the end of July 2021

